<title>USA: Tampa proseuctor says Columbia statement pending.</title>
<headline>Tampa proseuctor says Columbia statement pending.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Attorney in Tampa, Florida, will release a statement Wednesday concerning Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman declined to say if any charges had been brought or to say when the statement would be available.  The U.S. Attorney's office in Tampa oversees the Fort Myers, Fla., area.</p>
<p>((--Miami Bureau, 305-374-5013))</p>
